## Trace dispatcher declared-surface mapping — 2026-10-23

- Compared pinned Java 5.5.1 `TraceDispatcher` and `AsyncTraceDispatcher` public declarations and Java owner call sites with Rust dispatcher/Producer/Push/Lite APIs.
